body:
We are sending you a serial code that can be exchanged for Lodestar Gem x300 and Sacred Orb x1 on the Koei Tecmo WebStore.

*If you delete this mail, you will no longer be able to view the serial code. Please do not delete it until you have used it.

Serial Code: {serial_code}
{{open_browser href=clipboard:{serial_code}}}Tap here to copy to clipboard{{/open_browser}}

Koei Tecmo WebStore can be accessed {{open_browser href=https://www.gamecity.ne.jp/atelier/resleriana/ktstore/}}here{{/open_browser}}

*After logging in, you can navigate to the serial code input screen by selecting the three horizontal lines in the upper right of the screen ⇒ Username on mobile, or by selecting Username in the upper right of the screen on PC.
